reviews.text:
When I came to COEX for the exhibition, when I came to see the exhibition... I came here when I didn't have time and it was hard to stand in line and eat, but as expected, it wasn't delicious!
It tasted a bit like Jjajangmyeon, which cost 6,000 won, but the price was...ㅎ;;
The jjambbong was good because it contained more seafood than I expected, but it was too salty. The chili shrimp tasted like the familiar ketchup and chili.
